This is true when the item slot hasn't changed AND the stack is identical → definitely "no re-equip". So target should be 0.0 (fully up). Their code sets it to 1.0 (down). That IS inverted.

This is a real bug in the source mod. Since itemSwitch defaults to `false` in the mod, most users never saw it.

