252:         return step(yawDelta, pitchDelta, GameSettings.isKeyDown(bind));
253:     }
254: 
255:     /**
256:      * The whole state machine, with the bind state handed in.
257:      *
258:      * <p>Package-private so it can be exercised without a running game, where there is no
259:      * {@code Minecraft} to ask about a key bind.</p>
260:      *
