**Option A — full physics at the raised tickrate (what most clients do).** Simply set `ticksPerSecond`. Client-side gravity/movement scale with wall-clock, so you get rubber-banding on a server. On single-player (integrated server) the server ticks with the client, so it stays consistent and you just get a faster/smoother game. This is the "real" tick speed mod.

